[{"title":"梦中作四截句其二","author":"龚自珍","text":"黄金华发两飘萧，六九童心尚未消。\n叱起海红帘底月，四厢花影怒于潮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2064,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"漫感","author":"龚自珍","text":"绝域从军计惘然，东南幽恨满词笺。\n一箫一剑平生意，负尽狂名十五年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2065,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏史二首 其一","author":"龚自珍","text":"宣室今年起故侯，衔兼中外辖黄流。\n金銮午夜闻乾惕，银汉千寻泻豫州。\n猿鹤惊心悲皓月，鱼龙得意舞高秋。\n云梯关外茫茫路，一夜吟魂万里愁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2066,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"咏史","author":"龚自珍","text":"金粉东南十五州，万重恩怨属名流。\n牢盆狎客操全算，团扇才人踞上游。\n避席畏闻文字狱，著书都为稻粱谋。\n田横五百人安在，难道归来尽列侯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2067,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜坐其一","author":"龚自珍","text":"春夜伤心坐画屏，不如放眼入青冥。\n一山突起丘陵妒，万籁无言帝座灵。\n塞上似腾奇女气，江东久陨少微星。\n从来不蓄湘累问，唤出嫦娥诗与听。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2068,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"夜坐其二","author":"龚自珍","text":"沉沉心事北南东，一睨人材海内空。\n壮岁始参周史席，髫年惜堕晋贤风。\n功高拜将成仙外，才尽回肠荡气中。\n万一禅关砉然破，美人如玉剑如虹。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2069,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"逆旅题壁，次周伯恬原韵","author":"龚自珍","text":"名场阅历莽无涯，心史纵横自一家。\n秋气不惊堂内燕，夕阳还恋路旁鸦。\n东邻嫠老难为妾，古木根深不似花。\n何日冥鸿踪迹遂，美人经卷葬年华。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2070,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"赋忧患","author":"龚自珍","text":"故物人寰少，犹蒙忧患俱。\n春深恒作伴，宵梦亦先驱。\n不逐年华改，难同逝水徂。\n多情谁似汝？\n未忍托禳巫。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2071,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"秋心","author":"龚自珍","text":"秋心如海复如潮，惟有秋魂不可招。\n漠漠郁金香在臂，亭亭古玉佩当腰。\n气寒西北何人剑，声满东南几处箫。\n一川星斗烂无数，长天一月坠林梢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2072,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一九六","author":"龚自珍","text":"一十三度溪花红，一百八下西溪钟。\n卿家沧桑卿命短，渠侬不关关我侬。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2073,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一九七","author":"龚自珍","text":"一百八下西溪钟，一十三度溪花红。\n是恩是怨无性相，冥祥记里魂朦胧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2074,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其九","author":"龚自珍","text":"翠微山在柘潭侧，此山有情惨难别。\n薜荔风号义士魂，燕支土蚀佳人骨。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2075,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其十六","author":"龚自珍","text":"弃妇丁宁嘱小姑，姑恩莫负百年劬。\n米盐种种家常话，泪湿红裙未绝裾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2076,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二十二","author":"龚自珍","text":"车中三观夕惕若，七岁灵文电熠若。\n忏摩重起耳提若，三普贯珠累累若。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2077,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二十三","author":"龚自珍","text":"荒村有客抱蠹鱼，万一谈经引到渠。\n终胜秋燐无姓氏，沙涡门外五尚书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2078,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二十九","author":"龚自珍","text":"觥觥益阳风骨奇，壮年自定千首诗。\n勇于自信故英绝，胜彼优孟俯仰为。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2079,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其三十八","author":"龚自珍","text":"五十一人皆好我，八公送别益情亲。\n他年卧听除书罢，冉冉修名独伤神。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2080,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其三十九","author":"龚自珍","text":"朝借一经覆以簦，暮还一经龛已灯。\n龙华相见再相谢，借经功德龙泉僧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2081,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其五十","author":"龚自珍","text":"千言只作卑之论，敢以虚怀测上公？\n若问汉朝诸配享，少牢乞附孙叔通。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2082,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其五十九","author":"龚自珍","text":"端门授命有云礽，一脉微言我敬承。\n宿草敢祧刘礼部，东海绝学在毗陵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2083,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其六十二","author":"龚自珍","text":"古人制字鬼神泣，后人识字百忧集。\n我不畏鬼复不忧，灵文夜补秋灯碧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2084,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其六十三","author":"龚自珍","text":"经有家法夙所重，诗无远诂独不用。\n我心即是四始心，泬寥再发姬公梦。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2085,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其六十八","author":"龚自珍","text":"北游不至独石口，东游不至卢龙关。\n此记游耳非著作，马蹄蹀躞书生孱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2086,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其七十一","author":"龚自珍","text":"剔彼高山大川字，薄我玉箧金扃中。\n从此九州不光怪，羽陵夜色春熊熊。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2087,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其七十三","author":"龚自珍","text":"奇气一纵不可阖，此是借琐耗奇法。\n奇则耗矣琐未休，眼前胪列成五岳。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2088,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其七十四","author":"龚自珍","text":"登乙科则亡姓氏，官七品则亡姓氏。\n夜奠三十九布衣，秋灯忽吐苍虹气。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2089,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其九十九","author":"龚自珍","text":"能令公愠公复喜，扬州女儿名小云。\n初弦相见上弦别，不曾题满杏黄裙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2090,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一○二","author":"龚自珍","text":"网罗文献吾倦矣，选色谈空习性存。\n江淮狂生知我者，绿笺百字铭其言。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2091,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一一三","author":"龚自珍","text":"公子有德宜置诸，有德公子毋忘诸。\n我方乞籴忽诵此，箴铭磊落肝脾虚。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2092,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一一七","author":"龚自珍","text":"姬姜古妆不如市，赵女轻盈蹑锐屐。\n侯王宗庙求元妃，徽音岂在纤厥趾？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2093,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一二○","author":"龚自珍","text":"促柱危弦太觉孤，琴边倦眼眄平芜。\n香兰自判前因误，生不当门也被除。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2094,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一三四","author":"龚自珍","text":"五十一人忽少三，我闻陨涕江之南。\n箧中都有旧墨迹，从此袭以玫瑰函。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2095,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一三七","author":"龚自珍","text":"故人有子尚饘粥，抱君等身大著作。\n刘向而后此大宗，岂同陈晁竟目录。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2096,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一四一","author":"龚自珍","text":"铁师讲经门径仄，铁诗念佛颇得力。\n似师毕竟胜狂禅，师今迟我莲花国。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2097,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一四六","author":"龚自珍","text":"有明像法披猖后，荷担如来两尊宿。\n龙树马鸣齐现身，我闻大地狮子吼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2098,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一四九","author":"龚自珍","text":"只将愧汗湿莱衣，毁极堂堂岁月迟。\n世事沧桑心事定，此生一跌莫全非。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2099,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一五二","author":"龚自珍","text":"浙东虽秀太轻孱，北地雄奇或犷顽。\n踏遍中华窥两界，无双毕竟是家山。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2100,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一五五","author":"龚自珍","text":"除却虹生忆黄子，曝衣忽见黄罗衫。\n文章风谊细评度，岭南何减江之南？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2101,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一六一","author":"龚自珍","text":"如何从假入空法，君亦莫问我莫答。\n若有自性互不成，互不成者谁佛刹？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2102,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一六五","author":"龚自珍","text":"我言送客非佛事，师言不送非佛智。\n双照送是不送是，金光大地乔松寺。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2103,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一六七","author":"龚自珍","text":"曩向真州订古文，飞龙滂熹折纷纭。\n经生家法从来异，拓本模糊且饷君。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2104,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一六八","author":"龚自珍","text":"闭门三日了何事，题图祝寿谀人诗。\n双文单笔记序偈，突笔幸趁酒热时。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2105,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一六九","author":"龚自珍","text":"劘之道义拯之难，赏我出处好我书。\n史公副墨问姓氏，屈指首寄虬髯吴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2106,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一七一","author":"龚自珍","text":"猰貐猰貐厉牙齿，求覆我祖十世祀。\n我请于帝诅于鬼，亚驼巫阳莅鸡豕。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2107,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一七二","author":"龚自珍","text":"书梦亚驼告有意，明年三月猰貐死。\n大神羹枭殄枭子，焚香敬告少昊氏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2108,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一七五","author":"龚自珍","text":"琼林何不积缗钱，物自低昂人自便。\n我与徐公筹到此，朱提山竭亦无权。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2109,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一七七","author":"龚自珍","text":"藏书藏帖两高人，目录流传四十年。\n师友凋徂心力倦，羽陵一记亦荆榛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2110,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一八一","author":"龚自珍","text":"惠逆同门复同薮，谋臧不臧视朋友。\n我兹怦然谋乃心，君已砉然脱诸口。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2111,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一九一","author":"龚自珍","text":"蟠夔小印镂珊瑚，小字高华出汉书。\n原是狂生漫题赠，六朝碑例合镌无？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2112,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一九三","author":"龚自珍","text":"小婢口齿蛮复蛮，秋衫红泪潸复潸。\n眉痕约略弯复弯，婢如夫人难复难。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2113,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一九四","author":"龚自珍","text":"女儿魂魄完复完，湖山秀气还复还。\n炉香瓶卉残复残，他生重见艰复艰。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2114,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其一九八","author":"龚自珍","text":"草创江东署羽陵，异书奇石小崚嶒。\n十年松竹谁留守？\n南渡飞扬是中兴。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2115,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二○一","author":"龚自珍","text":"此是春秋据乱作，升平太平视松竹。\n何以功成文致之？\n携箫飞上羽陵阁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2116,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二○三","author":"龚自珍","text":"君家先茔邓尉侧，佳木生之杂绀碧。\n不看人间顷刻花，他年管领风云色。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2117,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二一一","author":"龚自珍","text":"万绿无人嘒一蝉，三层阁子俯秋烟。\n安排写集三千卷，料理看山五十年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2118,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二一二","author":"龚自珍","text":"海西别墅吾息壤，羽陵三重拾级上。\n明年俯看千树梅，飘飖亦是天际想。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2119,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二一三","author":"龚自珍","text":"此阁宜供天人师，檀香三尺博士为。\n阮公施香孰施字？\n徐公字似萧梁碑。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2120,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二一六","author":"龚自珍","text":"瑰癖消沉结习虚，一篇典宝古文无。\n金灯出土苔花碧，又照徐陵读汉书。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2121,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二二○","author":"龚自珍","text":"皇初任土乃作贡，卅七亩山可才众。\n媪神笑予无贫法，丹徒陆生言可用。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2122,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二二三","author":"龚自珍","text":"似笑山人不到家，争将晚节尽情夸。\n三秋不陨芙蓉■，九月犹开窅窳花。","collection":"清","notice":"含缺文或待核对标记，按原文保留。","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2123,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二二六","author":"龚自珍","text":"空观假观第一观，佛言世谛不可乱。\n人生宛有去来今，卧听檐花落秋半。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2124,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二三七","author":"龚自珍","text":"杭州梅舌酸复甜，有笋名曰虎爪尖。\n芼以苏州小橄榄，可敌北方冬菘腌。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2125,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二三九","author":"龚自珍","text":"阿咸从我十日游，遇管城子于虎丘。\n有笔可橐不可投，簪笔致身公与侯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2126,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二四二","author":"龚自珍","text":"谁肯甘心薄幸名，南舣北驾怨三生。\n劳人只有空王谅，那向如花辨得明？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2127,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二四八","author":"龚自珍","text":"小语精微沥耳圆，况聆珠玉泻如泉。\n一番心上温黁过，明镜明朝定少年。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2128,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二五八","author":"龚自珍","text":"云英化水景光新，略似骖鸾缥缈身。\n一队画师齐敛手，只容心里贮秾春。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2129,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二六八","author":"龚自珍","text":"万一天填恨海平，羽陵安稳贮云英。\n仙山楼阁寻常事，兜率甘迟十劫生。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2130,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二六九","author":"龚自珍","text":"美人捭阖计频仍，我佩阴符亦可凭。\n绾就同心坚待辱，羽陵山下是西陵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2131,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二七二","author":"龚自珍","text":"未济终焉心缥缈，百事翻从缺陷好。\n吟道夕阳山外山，古今谁免馀情绕？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2132,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二七六","author":"龚自珍","text":"少年虽亦薄汤武，不薄秦皇与汉武。\n设想英雄垂暮日，温柔不住住何乡？","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2133,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二七七","author":"龚自珍","text":"客心今雨匿旧雨，江痕早潮收暮潮。\n新欢且问黄婆渡，影事休提白傅桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2134,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二八一","author":"龚自珍","text":"少年无福过阙里，中年著书复求仕。\n仕幸不成书幸成，乃敢斋祓告孔子。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2135,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二八二","author":"龚自珍","text":"少为贱士抱弗宣，状为祠曹默益坚。\n议则不敢腰膝在，庑下一揖中夷然。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2136,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二八六","author":"龚自珍","text":"少年奇气称才华，登岱还浮八月搓。\n我过东方亦无负，清尊三宿孔融家。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2137,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二九四","author":"龚自珍","text":"前车辙浅后车缩，两车勒马让先跃。\n何况东阳绛灌年，贾生欀臂定礼乐。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2138,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二九五","author":"龚自珍","text":"古人用兵重福将，小说家名因果状。\n不信古书愎用知，水厄淋漓黑貂丧。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2139,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"己亥杂诗 其二九六","author":"龚自珍","text":"天意若曰汝毋北，覆车南沙书卷湿。\n汶阳风雨六幕黑，申以东平三尺雪。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":2140,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]